<Layout title="Jugaad tools"><main id="main" class="public-home"><p>Small tools. Useful outcomes.</p><h1>A little jugaad.<br/>A lot less friction.</h1><p>Six free browser tools. No AI calls, accounts, or server uploads.</p><ul><li><a href="/tools/sheet-autopsy">Sheet Autopsy ↗</a><p>Inspect CSV structure and missing or repeated values.</p></li><li><a href="/tools/promise-ledger">Promise Ledger ↗</a><p>Track commitments in a temporary local list.</p></li><li><a href="/tools/evals">Evals for Non-Coders ↗</a><p>Compare two responses with your own criteria and scores.</p></li><li><a href="/tools/split-fair">Split Fair ↗</a><p>Split a bill down to the last paisa.</p></li><li><a href="/tools/text-tidy">Text Tidy ↗</a><p>Clean whitespace, case, and repeated lines.</p></li><li><a href="/tools/time-bridge">Time Bridge ↗</a><p>Compare meeting times across time zones.</p></li></ul></main></Layout>
